<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Restaurant FFO raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Restaurant FFO raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>--EVEREN Securities Inc said Thursday it increased its 1998 funds from operations estimates on U.S. Restaurant Properties MLP to $2.76 from $2.72.</p>
<p>--It said the increase represents the higher than expected acquisitions year to date which have totaled $58 million.</p>
<p>--EVEREN said its price targets remain $31.50 for the six months and $34 for the 18 months.</p>
<p>--U.S. Restaurant Properties was down 1/8 at 28.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
